    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude05 <strong>Let me ask you this:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If life gave you a second chance\u2026<br>What kind of person would you become?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would you coast through life with the knowledge of the future like a lazy time traveler?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or would you break your own limits\u2014and become the <strong>Emperor of America</strong>?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc4a <strong>Next life, fight harder!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your past life, you were a code monkey buried in bugs and 996 shifts, living a life defined by social awkwardness and crippling insecurity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This life?<br>You\u2019re still holding a dishcloth\u2014but your mind holds the blueprint for a revolutionary app.<br>Armed with memories of the future, you decide it\u2019s time to stir up the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0e <strong>You\u2019ll go through:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dishwashing Chronicles:</strong> Swallow your pride and code between shifts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capitalist Thunderdome:</strong> Raise funds, crush competitors, move a billion units\u2014and casually acquire the White House.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Presidential Debate Livestream PK:</strong> Roast \u201cDonny the Builder\u201d on live TikTok, dominate the polls, and rule the Free World.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewrite the law. <strong>Rule them all.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd21 <strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue dripping with black humor and satire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cartoonish, ridiculous art style to match the madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the jaw-dropping life of <strong>Jack Ma 2.0</strong>, from busboy to Emperor of America.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0fThis is a text-based adventure game where you make choices for your second chance at life. Every decision matters.</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude05 <strong>Let me ask you this:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If life gave you a second chance\u2026<br>What kind of person would you become?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would you coast through life with the knowledge of the future like a lazy time traveler?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or would you break your own limits\u2014and become the <strong>Emperor of America</strong>?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc4a <strong>Next life, fight harder!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your past life, you were a code monkey buried in bugs and 996 shifts, living a life defined by social awkwardness and crippling insecurity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This life?<br>You\u2019re still holding a dishcloth\u2014but your mind holds the blueprint for a revolutionary app.<br>Armed with memories of the future, you decide it\u2019s time to stir up the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0e <strong>You\u2019ll go through:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dishwashing Chronicles:</strong> Swallow your pride and code between shifts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capitalist Thunderdome:</strong> Raise funds, crush competitors, move a billion units\u2014and casually acquire the White House.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Presidential Debate Livestream PK:</strong> Roast \u201cDonny the Builder\u201d on live TikTok, dominate the polls, and rule the Free World.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewrite the law. <strong>Rule them all.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd21 <strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue dripping with black humor and satire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cartoonish, ridiculous art style to match the madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the jaw-dropping life of <strong>Jack Ma 2.0</strong>, from busboy to Emperor of America.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0fThis is a text-based adventure game where you make choices for your second chance at life. Every decision matters.</h2>",
    "short_description": "In my past life, I was a broke, repressed code monkey\u2014laid off, heartbroken, a full-on loser. My life was a running joke. In this life, I started as a dishwasher, created FakeTok, ran for president, and rose to become the Emperor of America!",
